## Go Project Structure

```
go-service/
├── cmd/
│   └── server/
│       └── main.go           # entry: gin router, DB conn, env load
├── internal/
│   ├── auth/
│   │   ├── handler.go        # gin handlers: register, login, me
│   │   ├── service.go        # bcrypt, JWT issue
│   │   └── repository.go     # pgx queries
│   └── channels/
│       ├── handler.go        # REST: create, join, messages
│       ├── hub.go            # goroutine-based broadcast hub
│       ├── ws_handler.go     # WebSocket upgrade + read/write pump
│       ├── service.go        # business logic
│       └── repository.go     # pgx queries
├── pkg/
│   ├── middleware/
│   │   └── jwt.go            # gin middleware: validate JWT
│   └── db/
│       ├── postgres.go       # pgx pool init
│       └── redis.go          # ioredis-equivalent for Go
├── .env
├── go.mod
└── go.sum
```

