## Key Go Dependencies

| Package | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `github.com/gin-gonic/gin` | HTTP router |
| `github.com/gorilla/websocket` | WebSocket upgrade + read/write pumps |
| `github.com/jackc/pgx/v5` | PostgreSQL driver (no ORM) |
| `github.com/redis/go-redis/v9` | Redis client + Pub/Sub |
| `github.com/golang-jwt/jwt/v5` | JWT sign + verify |
| `golang.org/x/crypto/bcrypt` | Password hashing |
| `github.com/google/uuid` | UUID generation |
| `github.com/joho/godotenv` | [.env](file:///home/rakesh/Projects/polyglot-chat-architecture/backend/.env) loading |

---

## Frontend Changes Needed

| Change | Detail |
|--------|--------|
| Auth calls → Go | `axios.post("http://localhost:8080/auth/register")` etc. |
| Token storage | Store JWT in `location.state` (already done), pass to both services |
| Node axios calls | Add `Authorization: Bearer <token>` (already done) |
| Channel WebSocket | `new WebSocket("ws://localhost:8080/ws/channels/:id?token=...")` |
| Channel state | New React context or state for active channel + messages |
| UI | Channel sidebar section below DM users |

---

## Port Map

| Service | Port | Protocol |
|---------|------|---------|
| React frontend | 5173 | HTTP |
| Node.js chat | 5000 | HTTP + Socket.IO |
| Go service | 8080 | HTTP + raw WebSocket |
| MongoDB | 27017 | TCP |
| PostgreSQL | 5432 | TCP |
| Redis | 6379 | TCP |

